{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/12/4738096/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新学期が始まったということで学生の私は黒髪にしました〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/12/4738096/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地毛がもともと明るいから黒はなんだか自分の中でまだ慣れない‥"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/12/4738096/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなは新学期？この春？どんな感じですのぉ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/12/4738096/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/12/4738096/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近の私はなんかまだ春休み気分です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前も仕事行く前にアイス買って食べようと思って、ソフトクリームを買って、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よぉぉぉし！たべるぞ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/12/4738096/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って食べようと口元もって言ったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベチャッ！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って‥。\nマスクつけたの忘れててアイスとマスク大変なことなっちゃったの‥"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/12/4738096/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほかには定期券なくしちゃって\n久しぶりに切符使ったら、それに慣れてなくて\nなんか紙くず持ってる気分でなんも考えずに捨てちゃって切符買い直したり‥\n結局定期券も出てこず困っております。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/12/4738096/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！\nそう！この前ね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家から駅まで急ぎ足で言ってたら喉渇いちゃって買おうと思ってお札入れるとこに\nめっちゃ差し込んでも中々入らなくて‥"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え？ん？なんで？って思ったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"電子マネーのカードをそこに刺してた‥。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近何にも考えてないみたい‥"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/12/4738096/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/12/4738096/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなも気をつけてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/12/4738096/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/12/4738096/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カドカワとpopteen！ぜひ見てね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/12/4738096/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アルバムもまた発売させていただくことも決まり、\nノギビンゴ6もはじまりますねっ٩(๑˃̵ᴗ˂̵๑)۶ °"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/12/4738096/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして私はもうすぐ18歳だぁぁぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/12/4738096/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋田で誕生日迎えるんだぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/12/4738096/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年越しの瞬間はキリタンポでも食べながら年越ししようかなぁ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/12/4738096/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よし！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな夢の詰まった誕生日を過ごそう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/12/4738096/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最高のライブにするぞっ♪いまからもうたのしみだぁぁぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/12/4738096/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のお風呂は泡風呂の予定"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/12/4738096/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぁちゃんが\nまぁや〜おみあげ〜♪って泡風呂の入浴剤をおみあげで買ってきてくれたの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/12/4738096/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから早速使わせて頂く♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/12/4738096/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねぇしりとりって「ん」がついたら負けって言うじゃん？\nその意味を初めてこの前知ったの！！！！\n日本語で\nん\nから始まる言葉ってないんだね‥"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/04/12/4738096/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"衝撃！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bye"}],"source":"archive"}